{#
  "Ihre digitalen Inhalte sind bereit" (F-7, F20), to the customer, in the
  language of the order. Only for a release that happened on its own: at the
  end of the withdrawal period (F16) or once a key pool was refilled (F19).
  A release at the order or at the payment rides on the confirmation or on
  "Zahlung erhalten" instead.

  Keys are NOT in here (F20): a mail is not the place for a code that is
  money. The order page shows them.

  Variables:
    order      the order in InvoiceView's shape, in the order's language
    customer   {name, email}
    items      list of {quantity, name}: what was released now
    released   digital, service or mixed (DL3): which subject and intro
    invoice    the number of the invoice this release issued, attached; '' otherwise
    viewUrl    the order page, with a token
#}
{% block subject %}{{ ('CONSHO.mail.digitalReleased.' ~ released|default('digital') ~ '.subject')|trans([order.orderNumber], 'contao_default') }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
{% set font = 'font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #222222;' %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #f4f4f4;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_head.html.twig' %}
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; {{ font }}">
<tr><td style="padding: 24px 28px;">

<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.salutation'|trans([customer.name], 'contao_default') }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">{{ ('CONSHO.mail.digitalReleased.' ~ released|default('digital') ~ '.intro')|trans([order.orderNumber], 'contao_default') }}</p>

<ul style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
{% for item in items %}
    <li>{{ item.quantity }} × {{ item.name }}</li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>

{% if invoice|default('') %}
<p style="margin: 16px 0 0 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.digitalReleased.invoice'|trans([invoice], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}

<p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">
    <a href="{{ viewUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #222222; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.viewOrder'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</a>
</p>

</td></tr>
</table>
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_foot.html.twig' %}
</td></tr>
</table>
{% endblock %}
